{"file":"Agile Sprint Close-1.7.0-v1.zip","bytes":53708,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"agile-sprint-close","displayName":"Agile Sprint Close","description":"Sprint-close skills for Claude Code — tech-debt sweep, dev-stack closeout gate, QA validation (confirm-after-merge), and retrospective. Closes the sprint and feeds the next roadmap iteration. Needs the gh CLI + Atlassian MCP.","version":"1.7.0","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/cedricfarinazzo/agile-skills","homepage":"https://github.com/cedricfarinazzo/agile-skills","keywords":["agile","qa","retrospective","jira"]},{"path":".codex-plugin/plugin.json","name":"agile-sprint-close","description":"Close a sprint with debt review, closeout, QA validation, and retrospective workflows.","version":"1.7.0","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/cedricfarinazzo/agile-skills","homepage":"https://github.com/cedricfarinazzo/agile-skills","keywords":["agile","qa","retrospective","jira"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/agile-12-tech-debt-sweep/SKILL.md","name":"agile-12-tech-debt-sweep","description":"End-of-sprint housekeeping before closeout: audit cross-repo leakage, useless CI, prebuild-image wins, CLAUDE.md/SKILL.md cruft, misplaced artifacts, dead code. Report before apply. Triggers: tech debt sweep, cleanup sweep, housekeeping, /tech-debt-sweep. Before agile-13-sprint-closeout.","headings":["agile_12_tech_debt_sweep","Phase 0 — Inventory","Phase 1 — Audit (six categories, all run by default)","A — Cross-repo / personal leakage","B — `CLAUDE.md` / `SKILL.md` cruft","C — Useless CI workflows","D — Heavy Docker rebuilds → prebuild candidates","E — Misplaced artifacts","F — Dead / slop source code","Phase 2 — Report before apply","Tech debt sweep — report","A — Cross-repo / personal leakage      | File:line | Issue | Fix |","B — CLAUDE.md / SKILL.md cruft         | File:line | Issue | Lines saved | Fix |","C — Useless CI workflows               | Workflow | Why useless | Replacement |","D — Prebuild image candidates          | Layer | Rebuild cost per CI run | Target image | Notes |","E — Misplaced artifacts                | Source | Target repo | Notes |","F — Dead / slop source code            | File:line | Kind | Evidence (why dead) | Fix |","Summary"],"name_hint":"agile · 12 · tech · debt · sweep","description_zh":"在冲刺结束前检查跨仓库混入内容、无效 CI、预构建镜像机会、过时指令、错误位置产物和死代码；先报告再应用清理。"},{"path":"skills/agile-13-sprint-closeout/SKILL.md","name":"agile-13-sprint-closeout","description":"Mandatory end-of-sprint epic gate, 3 lenses: engineer (smoke + integration), architect (Confluence specs vs delivered code), tech lead (deep severity-graded review of all sprint diffs). Triggers: sprint closeout, close sprint, /sprint-closeout. After last merge + agile-12-tech-debt-sweep, before retro.","headings":["agile_13_sprint_closeout","Configuration","Phase 0 — Load epic spec","Phase 1 — Map epic ACs to code + tests","Phase 2 — Static cross-checks","Phase 3 — Architecture + Product alignment (Architect / PM lens)","Phase 4 — Tech Lead deep code review (impartial)","Critical","Minor","Nit","Phase 5 — Integration suite vs a fresh testing stack","Phase 6 — Dev stack smoke test (the part that catches the silent bugs)","Phase 6.5 — Merge-train Jira-link audit","Phase 7 — Final closeout report","Work discovered mid-phase — do it, or ticket it properly","Stop conditions","When NOT to use"],"name_hint":"agile · 13 · sprint · closeout","description_zh":"在最终合并和技术债清理后执行冲刺收尾门禁，从工程师的冒烟集成、架构师的规格实现对比及技术负责人全部差异深审三个视角核验。"},{"path":"skills/agile-14-qa-validation/SKILL.md","name":"agile-14-qa-validation","description":"QA validation, confirm-after-merge: Story already Done (merged) — confirm ACs hold on main, stamp sign-off, no transition. Regression → file a Bug, never reopen. Triggers: validate story, QA story, QA check, confirm ACs. After agile-13-sprint-closeout, before skill 15.","headings":["agile_14_qa_validation","Confluence structure (canonical — identical across all agile-skills)","Step 1 — Scan existing state","Step 2 — Collect the test results","Step 3 — Validate systematically","Step 4 — Sign off, or file a regression Bug","QA Sign-off (confirm-after-merge) — [date]","Bug report — [date]","What failed","Steps to reproduce (AC failures)","Severity","Step 5 — Resume logic","Step 6 — Advise","Principles"],"name_hint":"agile · 14 · qa · validation","description_zh":"对已合并且状态为 Done 的故事做 QA 验收：确认 main 上仍满足验收条件并签署通过，不改变状态；发现回归时新建 Bug，不重新打开故事。在 agile-13-sprint-closeout 后、技能 15 前使用，适用于验证故事、QA 检查及确认验收条件。"},{"path":"skills/agile-15-retro/SKILL.md","name":"agile-15-retro","description":"Sprint retro in Confluence + Roadmap update. Triggers: run retro, close sprint, what did we learn. After all Stories Done, hands off to skill 5.","headings":["agile_15_retro","Confluence structure (canonical — identical across all agile-skills)","Step 1 — Scan existing state","Step 1.5 — Load the sprint closeout report","Step 2 — Ensure the Retrospectives folder exists","Step 3 — Interview for retrospective inputs","Step 4 — Write the Retro page","Retro [N] — Sprint [N] — [Project Name]","Sprint summary","What went well ✅","What could be improved ⚠️","Action items 🎯","User & stakeholder feedback 👥","Technical debt logged 🔧","Velocity signal 📈","Carried-over Stories","Next iteration signals","Next Step"],"name_hint":"agile · 15 · retro","description_zh":"所有故事完成后，在 Confluence 进行冲刺复盘并更新路线图，适用于运行复盘、关闭冲刺及总结经验；完成后交给技能 5。"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["<img src=\".claude-plugin/icon.svg\" width=\"40\" alt=\"\" align=\"top\"> agile-sprint-close","Install","Skills (run in this order)","Sprint closeout — the third review layer","QA — confirm-after-merge only","Retro → next iteration","Confluence layout","Where it fits"]}],"mcp_servers":[],"config_names":[],"paths":[".claude-plugin/icon.svg",".claude-plugin/plugin.json",".codex-plugin/plugin.json","README.md","evals-closeout/.gitignore","evals-closeout/01-ac-without-integratio